similar role, preferably in hospitality or front office Knowledge of hotel management systems and basic computer skills (e.g., MS Office, Protel) Strong organizational and multitasking abilities Excellent communication and interpersonal skills Fluency in Greek and English Ability to work independently and remain calm under pressure   What we offer Competitive salary and benefits package Opportunities for professional development and training A supportive and collaborative work environment Accommodation (for resort locations) and meals provided   Ready to join our team?', 'Εποχιακός/ή'),
