es fluently in both English and Greek, verbally and in writing Demonstrates strong organizational skills and attention to detail Is familiar with hotel systems such as Protel or similar (considered an asset) Thrives in a fast-paced, multitasking environment Has a friendly, professional demeanor and a strong focus on guest satisfaction Is flexible to work shifts, including weekends and holidays   What We Offer Competitive salary and benefits package Opportunities for professional growth and development A supportive and inclusive working environment Accommodation (resort positions only) and meals provided   Ready to join our Community?', 'Εποχιακός/ή'),
