(639839, 'Receptionist - Athens', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/tourism-jobs/300979', 'Αθήνα', 'πριν ένα λεπτό', '2026-03-27 16:02:00', 'ZEUS INTERNATIONAL A.E.', 'Receptionist About the Role As a Receptionist, you will be the first point of contact for our guests and a key contributor to creating a positive and memorable first impression. Your role is central to delivering outstanding customer service and ensuring a smooth guest journey from arrival to departure. With strong communication skills, attention to detail, and a passion for hospitality, you will help create a welcoming and professional front-office experience.   Life at the Hotel The front desk is the heart of the hotel. Every day is different — check-ins, check-outs, guest requests, problem-solving, and close collaboration with all departments. In this fast-paced environment, flexibility, organization, and calm professionalism are essential. You will be part of a supportive and team-oriented workplace where guest satisfaction is always the priority.   What You’ll Do Manage guest arrivals and departures, ensuring a smooth and welcoming experience Handle reservations, modifications, and cancellations using the property management system Deliver excellent customer service by responding to inquiries and resolving complaints Coordinate with other departments to meet guest needs and requests Process payments, billing, and financial transactions accurately Provide guests with information on hotel facilities, local attractions, and transportation Maintain accurate records of guest information, transactions, and special requests Ensure the reception area remains tidy, organized, and inviting   Your Uniqueness is Welcome We believe outstanding receptionists combine professionalism with genuine warmth and hospitality. They are organized, adaptable, and always guest-focused. We’re looking for someone who: Has previous experience in a receptionist or front office role (hospitality experience is a plus) Communicates fluently in both English and Greek, verbally and in writing Demonstrates strong organizational skills and attention to detail Is familiar with hotel systems such as Protel or similar (considered an asset) Thrives in a fast-paced, multitasking environment Has a friendly, professional demeanor and a strong focus on guest satisfaction Is flexible to work shifts, including weekends and holidays   What We Offer Competitive salary and benefits package Opportunities for professional growth and development A supportive and inclusive working environment Accommodation (resort positions only) and meals provided   Ready to join our Community?', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
(639840, 'Head Waiter - Kos', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/tourism-jobs/300976', 'Παλλήνη', 'πριν μερικά δευτερόλεπτα', '2026-03-27 16:02:00', 'ZEUS INTERNATIONAL A.E.', 'Head Waiter About the role As a Waiter / Waitress, you will play a key role in shaping the dining experience of our guests. Through attentive service, menu knowledge, and genuine hospitality, you help turn every meal into a memorable moment.Your role blends professionalism, communication, and pace, ensuring that service flows smoothly while maintaining high standards of quality. Life Inside the Restaurant Behind every set table lies a story of flavors, people, and experiences. Some days follow a steady rhythm — orders flow, teamwork feels effortless, and service runs seamlessly. Other days are more dynamic — higher volume, diverse guest needs, and moments that call for flexibility and quick thinking.Within this environment, you bring consistency, positive energy, and attention to detail. What you’ll do Welcome and serve guests with a friendly, professional approach Take and relay orders accurately to the kitchen or bar Present the menu, make recommendations, and answer guest questions Maintain clean, organized dining areas at all times Collaborate closely with kitchen staff and fellow team members Process bills and payments efficiently and accurately Follow all health, safety, and hygiene standards Address guest requests or concerns promptly to ensure satisfaction Your Uniqueness is Welcome We believe great waiters and waitresses are defined not only by speed or technique, but by their ability to connect with guests and create a welcoming atmosphere.If you enjoy working with people and delivering meaningful hospitality, you’ll feel right at home with us. We’re looking for someone who: Has previous experience in a similar role (preferred but not required) Demonstrates excellent communication and interpersonal skills Can multitask effectively in a fast-paced environment Has a positive attitude and strong team spirit Pays attention to detail and service quality Possesses basic math skills for handling payments What we offer Competitive salary and benefits A welcoming and dynamic working environment Opportunities for professional growth Accommodation (resorts only) and meals provided Ready to join our Community?', 'Εποχιακός/ή'),
(639841, 'Head Waiter - Chalkidiki', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/tourism-jobs/300975', 'Παλλήνη', 'πριν 19 λεπτά', '2026-03-27 16:02:02', 'ZEUS INTERNATIONAL A.E.', 'Head Waiter About the role As a Waiter / Waitress, you will play a key role in shaping the dining experience of our guests. Through attentive service, menu knowledge, and genuine hospitality, you help turn every meal into a memorable moment.Your role blends professionalism, communication, and pace, ensuring that service flows smoothly while maintaining high standards of quality. Life Inside the Restaurant Behind every set table lies a story of flavors, people, and experiences. Some days follow a steady rhythm — orders flow, teamwork feels effortless, and service runs seamlessly. Other days are more dynamic — higher volume, diverse guest needs, and moments that call for flexibility and quick thinking.Within this environment, you bring consistency, positive energy, and attention to detail. What you’ll do Welcome and serve guests with a friendly, professional approach Take and relay orders accurately to the kitchen or bar Present the menu, make recommendations, and answer guest questions Maintain clean, organized dining areas at all times Collaborate closely with kitchen staff and fellow team members Process bills and payments efficiently and accurately Follow all health, safety, and hygiene standards Address guest requests or concerns promptly to ensure satisfaction Your Uniqueness is Welcome We believe great waiters and waitresses are defined not only by speed or technique, but by their ability to connect with guests and create a welcoming atmosphere.If you enjoy working with people and delivering meaningful hospitality, you’ll feel right at home with us. We’re looking for someone who: Has previous experience in a similar role (preferred but not required) Demonstrates excellent communication and interpersonal skills Can multitask effectively in a fast-paced environment Has a positive attitude and strong team spirit Pays attention to detail and service quality Possesses basic math skills for handling payments What we offer Competitive salary and benefits A welcoming and dynamic working environment Opportunities for professional growth Accommodation (resorts only) and meals provided Ready to join our Community?', 'Εποχιακός/ή'),
