nd wines. Fluency in English. Strong attention to detail and strict adherence to hygiene standards. Communication and collaboration skills, problem-solving abilities, and a strong guest-focused orientation.   Benefits Double accommodation (A/C, refrigerator, shared laundry facilities). Half board. Continuous training and professional development opportunities. Provision of work uniform. Stable and structured working environment.   All applications will be treated with absolute confidentiality. After careful evaluation of the CVs, we will contact only the candidates who meet the requirements of the position. #bettertogether #workforall', 'Εποχιακός/ή'),
(639967, 'Night Auditor (Santorini, Kamari)', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/tourism-jobs/301109', 'Θήρα', 'πριν 4 λεπτά', '2026-03-27 22:00:19', 'Work For All', 'Night Auditor (Santorini, Kamari)   About Work For All Work For All is a specialized recruitment and staffing company dedicated to achieving the best possible match between candidates and employers. We support employees in their professional development and help businesses grow sustainably by providing the right personnel. Our vision is a workplace with equal opportunities for all, where diversity is a strength and inclusion leads to success.   Work For All is seeking Night Auditor on behalf of 3* hotel in Santorini, part of a large hotel group.   About the Hotel Group The hotel group operates in Santorini and manages four hotel units ranging from 3* to 5*, located in the areas of Fira, Caldera, and Kamari, with a total of 249 rooms and suites. The group offers high-quality hospitality services, combining modern aesthetics with the authentic experience of the island, placing particular emphasis on service quality and the overall guest experience. The group’s properties feature modern facilities and a wide range of amenities, including restaurants, bars, and beach bars, as well as wellness areas with spa, sauna, and swimming pools, offering guests moments of relaxation and rejuvenation. The hotels are designed to accommodate different hospitality needs, as some properties are family-friendly and ideal for families and groups of friends, while others provide a more tranquil adults-only environment, creating a complete accommodation experience for every type of guest.   About the Hotel Located just a few steps from the beach in Kamari, Santorini, the hotel is a welcoming 3-star destination, ideal for relaxing seaside holidays. With 106 comfortable and functional rooms, the property offers an enjoyable and affordable stay, combining simplicity with authentic Greek hospitality. The hotel features a large outdoor 