(641511, 'AI Team Lead', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/it-jobs/292566', 'Θεσσαλονίκη', 'πριν ένα μήνα', '2026-03-30 07:00:26', 'Netcompany', 'Company DescriptionAre you ready to shape the future technological landscape in Europe?We are dedicated to responsible digitalisation, building innovative, inclusive solutions that drive meaningful impact. With over 8,900 professionals across Europe, we help EU institutions, public and private organisations thrive in a rapidly evolving digital world. Are you ready to shape the future through technology? Your journey starts here. Take a look at some of our impactful projects here: https://netcompany.com/cases/Job DescriptionSo, what are the main responsibilities of the AI Team Lead in Netcompany? Joining us as the AI Team Lead, you will own the end-to-end delivery of GenAI and LLM solutions for enterprise clients. You will act as a trusted advisor to senior client stakeholders, translating complex AI capabilities into tangible business outcomes, while building and leading a high-performing team of AI engineers. This is a client-facing leadership role. Your ability to navigate complex stakeholder environments, manage expectations, and drive alignment across business and technology teams will be as important as your technical expertise. You will be the primary AI point of contact for key accounts, presenting to C-level executives, leading workshops, and shaping AI adoption roadmaps. Focus (but not limited to) the design and implementation of advanced GenAI solutions. You will drive the team to build end-to-end GenAI pipelines by developing and applying creative solutions that go beyond current tools and ensure your team delivers scalable, reusable, extensible and flexible solutions. As the AI Team Lead, you will:Serve as the primary AI advisor to key enterprise clients, understanding their business challenges and translating them into AI-powered solutions that deliver measurable value. Lead and grow a team of AI engineers to design, develop, and optimize GenAI architectures tailored to client-specific use cases and business requirements. Manage stakeholder relationships across multiple concurrent projects, including steering committees, progress reporting, and escalation management. Deliver end-to-end GenAI and LLM applications for key client transformation projects across the region and international business. Mentor and develop team members, identifying skill gaps, and creating individual development plans. Lead client workshops, discovery sessions, and technical presentations to shape AI strategy and drive adoption. Execute the GenAI and LLM strategy including people, technology, methodologies, platforms, and processes. QualificationsWhat would make you a fit for the role:Bachelor\'s or Master\'s degree in Data Science, Machine Learning, Computer Science, Engineering or a related field. 6+ years of experience in AI/ML engineering, with a proven track record of delivering AI projects in enterprise/consulting environments from conception to production, with at least 2 years in a people management or practice leadership role. Demonstrated experience managing client relationships, leading workshops, and presenting technical solutions to non-technical senior stakeholders (C-level, board members, steering committees). Experience leading and developing teams, including hiring, performance management, and career development. Strong expertise in GenAI solutions including prompt engineering, RAG architectures, LLM evaluation, and production deployment patterns. Experience designing and implementing scalable AI solutions on cloud platforms (AWS, Azure). It would also be a plus if you match some of the following:Experience in consulting, systems integration, or professional services environments. Experience with AIOps practices, LLM monitoring frameworks, and AI governance. Knowledge of frameworks like LlamaIndex, LangGraph, and AI evaluation tools. Pre-sales or business development experience in AI/data services.Additional InformationBeing a part of the Netcompany team, you will be provided with: The opportunity to work in a modern environment & in a hybrid working modelA seamless onboarding experience and a buddy to support you on your first stepsA competitive compensation & benefits packageHealth and life insurance programMeal and commuting allowanceWell-being activities (on premises)Continuous learning opportunities using the most modern methods (unlimited access to Udemy for Business, ad-hoc trainings)A personalized development plan for targeted career growthIf you are looking forward to be part of a diverse environment, and have the opportunity to work alongside well-experienced professionals, on challenging, large-scale projects that directly impact millions of citizens around the globe, then this is the place to be!Our branch in Thessaloniki employs 300+ talented professionals, working on a variety of EU mission-critical projects!Please upload your CV in English via the Apply button. All applications will be treated as strictly confidential.We ensure equal opportunities, treatment, and consideration to all candidates. Discrimination based on sex, racial or ethnic origin, religion or belief, disability, age, sexual orientation or marital status, physical or mental disability, or any other factor protected by applicable laws and regulations is prohibited. As part of the Netcompany culture, we respect human rights and focus on creating a positive workplace, where all employees are valued, and where diversity and inclusion are a vital part of our everyday working experience.In the following link you may find our CV Submission privacy notice: https://netcompany.com/cv-submission-privacy-notice/', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
(641514, 'Πωλητής Τυπογραφείου', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/sales-or-business-development-or-account-management-jobs/301206', 'Άγιος Ιωάννης Ρέντης', 'πριν 7 ώρες', '2026-03-30 07:00:29', 'Oneiropolhs', 'Αναζητούμε πωλητή για τυπογραφείο με στόχο την ανάπτυξη του πελατολογίου και την ενίσχυση των συνεργασιών μας. Ο ρόλος περιλαμβάνει ενεργή προσέγγιση νέων πελατών, δημιουργία και διατήρηση επαγγελματικών σχέσεων, καθώς και οργάνωση συναντήσεων για την παρουσίαση των υπηρεσιών μας. Ο ιδανικός υποψήφιος διαθέτει επικοινωνιακές δεξιότητες, εμπειρία στον χώρο και διάθεση για εξέλιξη. Το ωράριο είναι 10:00–18:00 με ευελιξία λόγω της φύσης της θέσης Παρέχεται εταιρικό αυτοκίνητο', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
(641516, 'ΔΙΕΥΘΥΝΤΗΣ / ΔΙΕΥΘΥΝΤΡΙΑ ΚΑΤΑΣΤΗΜΑΤΟΣ ΕΣΤΙΑΣΗΣ', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/food-or-cafe-jobs/301209', 'Γλυφάδα', 'πριν 8 ώρες', '2026-03-30 07:00:31', 'MANTECARE MON. IKE', ' New Restaurant in Glyfada: Join our team! Το νέο εστιατόριο της Γλυφάδας ετοιμάζεται και αναζητάμε τους ανθρώπους που θα δώσουν πνοή στην κουζίνα και το σέρβις μας! Αν έχεις εμπειρία, μεράκι για το φαγητό και θέλεις να δουλέψεις σε ένα περιβάλλον που σε υπολογίζει πραγματικά, σε περιμένουμε.   Ποιους αναζητούμε: • Διευθυντής / Διευθύντρια Καταστήματος: Με εμπειρία στην εστίαση και όρεξη για δουλειά   Γιατί να έρθεις μαζί μας; Προσφέρουμε ένα πακέτο που ξεχωρίζει, γιατί ξέρουμε τι σημαίνει καλή δουλειά: • 💰 Μισθός ανώτερος του κλάδου: Η εμπειρία σου αμείβεται δίκαια και γενναία. • ⚖️ 100% Νόμιμη Απασχόληση: Όλα τα ένσημα, δώρα και επιδόματα στο ακέραιο. • 🕒 Σεβασμός στο Ωράριο: Σταθερό πρόγραμμα και ρεπό που τηρούνται (Full-time & Part-time). • 🍝 Staff Meal: Καθημερινό ποιοτικό γεύμα από το μενού μας. • 🚀 Ευκαιρία Εξέλιξης: Σε ένα brand  με μεγάλες προοπτικές.   Τι ζητάμε: • Απαραίτητη προϋπηρεσία (κατά προτίμηση σε αντίστοιχο κόνσεπτ) • Ομαδικό πνεύμα και επαγγελματική συνέπεια. • Διάθεση για δημιουργία σε ένα νέο, σύγχρονο χώρο.   Επικοινωνία: 📧 Στείλε μας το βιογραφικό σου στο: [email protected] 📞 Ή κάλεσε μας απευθείας: +30 6947038841', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
