, OTA’s extranets and Property Management systems, preferably Opera Excellent communication skills and teamwork spirit Previous working experience with Hilton Hotels & Resorts is considered an additional asset Benefits At Conrad Corfu, joining our team is a unique opportunity to grow your career in a world-class luxury environment. Our Team Members enjoy: Competitive pay that recognizes your talent and contribution On-the-job training and workshops to keep your skills sharp Career growth opportunities at every stage of your journey Staff accommodation provided, allowing you to live the destination, not just the job Daily meals in our staff restaurant Discounts at our on-site outlets Uniform provided Laundry allowance Access to the global training platforms and our library for learning, personal development, and career growth Exclusive hotel rates and special offers for team members in the international hotels of the brand Winter work abroad opportunities, to explore international career paths   But before we meet, check out the main VALUES that represent the company and thus we are looking for in you: Teamwork – We’re stronger together! Integrity – Do the right thing, even when no one is watching! Respect – We honor all voices, and every idea counts! Kindness – A smile goes a long way! Creativity – If you can think outside the box and color outside the lines, you\'re our kind of person!   At Conrad Corfu, this is more than a job - it’s a chance to be part of a legacy of excellence in luxury hospitality! We are an equal opportunities employer – All applications will be considered as confidential. Only suitable candidates will be contacted. #ShapeTomorrow', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
