(647688, 'Senior Plumber', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/retail-jobs/304103?origin=pjp', 'Αθήνα', 'πριν 16 λεπτά', '2026-04-08 15:01:16', 'Κωτσόβολος', 'At Kotsovolos, we believe in your uniqueness and everything you have to offer!Here, you create your own current!📈 Our achievements in numbers3,000+ People | 100+ Stores | 2 Logistics Centers - 77.000 sqm | 2 Call Centers | 2 Modern Training Centers | Kapaskill - our live, personalized learning ecosystem | 75,000+ hours of training per year | 400+ different roles & 49 Business Units🎯 Our purposeBetter Living. Everywhere. for Everyone!💼 Your everyday work-life Define customers\' needs and provide solutions regarding plumbing and heating issues Execute services in customer\'s houses Install, test and maintain plumbing systems, piping, and fixtures in residential settings Install and initialize Heat Pump systems, ensuring proper flow and system integration Upgrade or replace plumbing systems to meet current efficiency and safety standards Perform thorough inspections of existing plumbing and heating installations to ensure compliance with local regulations Identify potential hazards Use appropriate testing tools and equipment to verify plumbing and heat pump system integrity 🚀 As an ideal fit, you should have 3+ years of relevant work experience as a field plumber, with a proven track record in residential and commercial systems Specialized expertise in Heat Pumps, with extensive experience in the installation, wiring interface and full initialization/commissioning of air-source or water-source heat pump units Technical degree and Professional License: Graduation from a relative technical institute and possession of a Master Plumber or Journeyman License Proficiency with advanced diagnostic equiment (ultrasonic leak detectors, combustion analyzers, digital manifolds for HVAC/Heat Pump troubleshooting Leadership capabillities Excellent communication skills Strong troubleshooting and problem solving skills Advanced compute