(648337, 'Enterprise Service Center Specialist', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/call-center-or-customer-support-jobs/304521?origin=pjp', 'Αθήνα', 'πριν 5 λεπτά', '2026-04-09 15:01:05', 'Vodafone', 'Join UsAt Vodafone, we\'re not just shaping the future of connectivity for our customers - we\'re shaping the future for everyone who joins our team. When you work with us, you\'re part of a global mission to connect people, solve complex challenges, and create a sustainable and more inclusive world. If you want to grow your career whilst finding the perfect balance between work and life, Vodafone offers the opportunities to help you belong and make a real impact.What you\'ll doThe scope of the role is to provide technical support to enterprise customers of Vodafone directly or to other teams that supports those customers, which have a multiple presence throughout our country, and they want to connect these points together (for voice and data services) or they want to connect these points on the Internet. All these connections are served through our Metro Ethernet, microwave, PSTN and GSM networks and the role is responsible to ensure the availability and quality of services for all these connections, from the customer\'s endpoint to Vodafone production networks (IMS network for Voice or ISP network for Internet etc).• Troubleshoot and resolve customer technical issues which arise after service activation. • Perform all required actions to support Legacy Services to customer, also doing all Vodafone internal coordination activities that follow the troubleshooting process.• Organize field technician visits to customer premises in order to perform all appropriate actions.• Perform Services Proactive Monitoring and run health checks. • Send technical incident reports to Business customers.Who you are• Technical education with qualifications in telecommunications, electronics, and computing. • Excellent knowledge of LAN and WAN network topologies at layers 1,2 and 3 of the OSI 