fone isn\'t a concept; it\'s lived, breathed, and cultivated through everything we do. You\'ll be part of a global and diverse community, with many different minds, abilities, backgrounds and cultures. ;We\'re committed to increase diversity, ensure equal representation, and make Vodafone a place everyone feels safe, valued and included.If you require any reasonable adjustments or have an accessibility request as part of your recruitment journey, for example, extended time or breaks in between online assessments, please refer to https://careers.vodafone.com/application-adjustments/ for guidance.Together we can.', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
(648349, '2026 Vodafone Greece Internship Program', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/operations-jobs/304522?origin=pjp', 'Φουρνάς', 'πριν 2 ώρες', '2026-04-09 15:01:17', 'Vodafone', 'Vodafone Internship ProgramAbout the Program:Are you interested in working at a fast paced technology multinational company? Are you a university student or a recent graduate? Are you exploring real-life employment opportunities? Do you want to gain international know-how in different areas and thrive? Then you are at the right place! Kick-start your career with an exciting Internship at Vodafone. You can find yourself working practically anywhere in our business, from Technology, Software Development, Finance, HR and Marketing to Product Management and Sales. Program DetailsWhy apply:• Gain know-how in various business areas from international experts • Acquire business experience and accountability from day one • Invest in your personal development with best-in-class digital learning and tools • Challenge yourself and learn how to thrive • Get an overview of future employment • Hybrid way of working: a blend of remote and office-based working • The opportunity to fast track to our Discover Graduate ProgramWhat we\'re looking for:• Education: University student or graduate • Language skills: Greek and English • Love for technology and the digital era • Curious mindset with learning agility• Motivation to meet us and work with the best Vodafone teams • Previous experience is not requiredApplication ProcessYou are one click away. Press the button below to share your CV. You will then receive an invitation for an online interview, where some short questions are waiting for you to help us select the most motivated candidates to join the program!Internship program duration: 3-6 monthsWhen you combine technology and the human spirit, anything is possible. And when you join Vodafone, we\'ll help you shape a rewarding career that gives back in more ways than one. It starts here. It starts with you.#LI-Hybrid #Vodafonespirit #TogetherwecanStay connected: Vodafone.gr Careers, Vodafone Careers Facebook, Vodafone LinkedInFor any further assistance, please feel free to reach out to us on [email protected]', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
