ce, where all employees are valued, and where diversity and inclusion are a vital part of our everyday working experience.In the following link you may find our CV Submission privacy notice: https://netcompany.com/cv-submission-privacy-notice/', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
(650061, '🌟Join ERGO as an Insurance & Investment Consultant in Larissa🌟', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/marketing-or-advertising-jobs/304692', 'Λάρισα', 'πριν 8 ώρες', '2026-04-12 07:00:37', 'ERGO ΑΣΦΑΛΙΣΤΙΚΗ ΜΟΝΟΠΡΟΣΩΠΗ Α.Ε.', 'Do you enjoy building trust, helping people, and creating meaningful solutions?Are you ready to take charge of your career and grow in a dynamic, supportive environment? At ERGO, one of the leading insurance companies in Greece, we are expanding our team in Larisa and looking for motivated individuals who want more than just a job — they want a career with purpose. 🚀 What You’ll Be Doing Listen to clients, understand their needs, and design tailored insurance and investment solutions that truly make a difference in their lives. Build long-term relationships of trust with individuals and businesses in your community. Work closely with your ERGO team to identify new opportunities and grow your client network. Embrace digital tools and modern ways of working that make your job easier and your impact greater.   🎁 What We Offer Comprehensive training & mentoring — no prior insurance experience required. We’ll guide you step by step. Financial support during your first 2 years, so you can focus on learning and growing. Continuous development — regular workshops, coaching, and personal growth opportunities. Health insurance coverage for you, because we care about those who care for others. The chance to become the CEO of yourself — flexible schedule, independence, and uncapped income potential.   ✅ What We’re Looking For A genuine passion for helping people and offering real solutions. Ambition and drive to build your own career as an independent consultant. Comfort with digital tools and a good command of English. A growth mindset — open to continuous learning and professional development. (Don’t worry if you don’t have the Insurance Agent license (ΤτΕ) yet — we’ll help you obtain it!)   🌍 Why Join ERGO? We don’t just sell policies.We empower people to feel secure, confident, and ready for the future.As part of ERGO, you’ll join a strong international group while enjoying the flexibility and independence of being your own boss.   👉 Ready to take the next step in your career? Apply today and start your journey with ERGO Sales team! Δες περισσότερα :https://www.ergohellas.gr/exclusive-insurance-partners  Πολιτική διαχείρισης προσωπικών  δεδομένων: https://www.ergohellas.gr/personal-data-partner/', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση / Μερική απασχόληση'),
