(653052, 'Buyer', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/general-management-jobs/305842?origin=pjp', 'Μαγούλα', 'πριν 2 ώρες', '2026-04-16 15:03:16', 'Plaisio Computers S.A.', 'What you will do as a Buyer @Plaisio: ✅ Ensure a proper stock of product range ✅ Communicate with suppliers, sales and logistics departments  ✅ Monitoring statistical inventories, sales and trending movements of competition ✅ Cooperate and participate in the promotion of the product category ✅ Monitor the market for new and existing products  How you match: ✅ Degree from AEI / TEI / IEK ✅ Desired relevant experience ✅ Excellent written and spoken English as well as, excellent Excel skills  ✅ High attention to detail and excellent analytical and numerical skills ✅ Excellent team player, with the ability to work independently as well as under pressure ✅ Computer skills on MS Office, ERP (such as SAP) will be considered as an asset  How we partner: 🔴 Join the most creative team in the market 🔴 Be a member of an awarded team in Greek Retail 🔴 Work in a passionate & flexible environment 🔴 Own projects and develop yourself 🔴 Enjoy the full package of Plaisio Benefits & corporate trainings  Our Team:  ⭐We are the No1 technology retailer in Greece, delivering excellent customer experience ⭐We are an Omnichannel retailer with 24 stores, 2 high- end Fulfillment Centers & a \"state of the art”, Customer Support Center ⭐We are a team of 1500 #plaisiopeople ⭐We have fun, do good, work smart & post on #plaisiopeople Instagram ⭐We love to achieve, to innovate, and think out-of-the box  Think we match? Join Us!  #plaisiopeople #plaisioteam #UinRetail #LifeAtPlaisio ', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
