eam spirit Pays attention to detail and service quality Possesses basic math skills for handling payments What we offer Competitive salary and benefits A welcoming and dynamic working environment Opportunities for professional growth Accommodation (resorts only) and meals provided Ready to join our Community?', 'Εποχιακός/ή'),
(656918, 'Head Waiter - Athens', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/tourism-jobs/307799', 'Αθήνα', 'πριν μία ώρα', '2026-04-22 15:01:54', 'ZEUS INTERNATIONAL A.E.', 'Head Waiter About the role As a Waiter / Waitress, you will play a key role in shaping the dining experience of our guests. Through attentive service, menu knowledge, and genuine hospitality, you help turn every meal into a memorable moment.Your role blends professionalism, communication, and pace, ensuring that service flows smoothly while maintaining high standards of quality. Life Inside the Restaurant Behind every set table lies a story of flavors, people, and experiences. Some days follow a steady rhythm — orders flow, teamwork feels effortless, and service runs seamlessly. Other days are more dynamic — higher volume, diverse guest needs, and moments that call for flexibility and quick thinking.Within this environment, you bring consistency, positive energy, and attention to detail. What you’ll do Welcome and serve guests with a friendly, professional approach Take and relay orders accurately to the kitchen or bar Present the menu, make recommendations, and answer guest questions Maintain clean, organized dining areas at all times Collaborate closely with kitchen staff and fellow team members Process bills and payments efficiently and accurately Follow all health, safety, and hygiene standards Address guest requests or concerns promptly to ensure satisfaction Your Uniqueness is Welcome We believe great waiters and waitresses are defined not only by speed or technique, but by their ability to connect with guests and create a welcoming atmosphere.If you enjoy working with people and delivering meaningful hospitality, you’ll feel right at home with us. We’re looking for someone who: Has previous experience in a similar role (preferred but not required) Demonstrates excellent communication and interpersonal skills Can multitask effectively in a fast-paced environment Has a positive attitude and strong team s