(658155, 'Student Support Manager', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/administrative-or-secretarial-jobs/308659', 'Αθήνα', 'πριν 7 λεπτά', '2026-04-24 15:00:27', 'SME Consortium LTD', 'Main Tasks A professional approach in promptly answering customer inquiries and to provide information about our products and services. Manage and assist students with their inquiries and issues whilst studying in different countries across Europe. Manage various social media correspondence on different forums for the organization. Escalate unresolved queries to respective departments across the organization for accurate resolution Supporting students by responding to questions and queries in a timely manner. Maintaining records of interactions with students & customers. Appropriate and timely follow-ups wherever required. Work with various teams across the organization to resolve any issues or concerns. Language requirements: English native speaker. MS Word and Excel is essential. Supervising a small team to create online virtual events. Working on and reporting to the company manager regarding various business development projects.', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
(658156, 'Εργάτες Αποθήκης (Ρέντη)', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/logistics-or-warehouse-jobs/308669', 'Αθήνα', 'πριν 10 λεπτά', '2026-04-24 15:00:29', 'ManpowerGroup Greece', 'Διαθέτεις ή επιθυμείς να αποκτήσεις εμπειρία στην εφοδιαστική αλυσίδα; 🚚 👷 Αναζητάς το επόμενο επαγγελματικό σου βήμα σε περιβάλλον χονδρικού εμπορίου; 🍎   Η ManpowerGroup Greece, για λογαριασμό πελάτη της, εταιρεία η οποία δραστηριοποιείται στον χώρο του χονδρικού εμπορίου φρέσκων φρούτων και λαχανικών αναζητά Εργάτες Αποθήκης.     📌 Τοποθεσία: Άγιος Ιωάννης Ρέντης 📅 Ημέρες και Ωράριο Απασχόλησης: 8ωρη ή part time 5νθήμερη απασχόληση 💼 Σύμβαση: Αορίστου χρόνου   Τι θα χρειαστεί να κάνεις: Παραλαβή και εκφόρτωση/φόρτωση προϊόντων Ταξινόμηση των προϊόντων στα ράφια Χρήση παλετοφόρου Συσκευασία των προϊόντων Καθαριότητα και τήρηση κανόνων υγιεινής   Τι αναζητούμε: Απόφοιτος/η Δευτεροβάθμιας Εκπαίδευσης Εργασιακή εμπειρία σε περιβάλλον αποθήκης (όχι απαραίτητη)  Επαγγελματική συμπεριφορά και ομαδικό πνεύμα  Ανεπτυγμένη ικανότητα οργάνωσης και προγραμματισμού εργασιών      Πακέτο αποδοχών και παροχών: ✔️    Ανταγωνιστικό πακέτο αποδοχών 📖 Συνεχής εκπαίδευση και δυνατότητες εξέλιξης σε ένα οργανωμένο περιβάλλον εργασίας 👥 Τα στάδια πρόσληψης περιλαμβάνουν: Αν εμπίπτει στα ενδιαφέροντα σας αυτός ο ρόλος, μη διστάσετε να υποβάλετε απευθείας αίτηση. Οι σύμβουλοί μας θα επικοινωνήσουν με τους υποψηφίους που πληρούν τις παραπάνω απαιτήσεις για να προγραμματίσουν συνέντευξη. Όσον αφορά τα επόμενα βήματα, θα υπάρξει 1 ακόμη συνέντευξη με την εταιρεία/πελάτη δια ζώσης   #Empoweringtalent #WebelieveinTalent #ManpowerGroupGreece', 'Πλήρης απασχόληση'),
(658157, 'Receptionist Ά (Elounda)', 'https://www.kariera.gr/jobs/tourism-jobs/308670', 'Άγιος Νικόλαος', 'πριν 35 λεπτά', '2026-04-24 15:00:29', 'Work For All', 'Receptionist Ά (Elounda)   About Work For All Work For All is a specialized recruitment and staffing company dedicated to achieving the best possible match between candidates and employers. We support employees in their professional development and help businesses grow sustainably by providing the right personnel. Our vision is a workplace with equal opportunities for all, where diversity is a strength and inclusion leads to success.   Work For All is seeking a Receptionist Ά on behalf of luxury 5* hotel in Elounda,Crete.   About the Hotel Located in the prestigious area of Elounda in Crete, this refined adults-only hotel offers a serene escape where elegance meets the beauty of the Cretan landscape. The property features 237 stylish rooms, thoughtfully designed to provide comfort, sophistication, and a relaxing stay experience. Guests can indulge in a diverse culinary journey across four restaurants, serving Mediterranean, Greek, and international cuisine throughout the day. The hotel also boasts three bars, perfect for enjoying signature cocktails and light refreshments in a tranquil setting. A fully equipped spa invites guests to unwind and rejuvenate, enhancing the overall sense of well-being. Ideal for couples and adult travelers, the hotel combines upscale hospitality, a peaceful ambiance, and attentive service, creating a welcoming and memorable destination in Elounda.   Key Responsibilities Maintaining thorough knowledge of the hotel’s facilities, services, and the features of each room category. Managing guest arrivals and departures efficiently. Handling guest requests and interactions with a high level of service. Overseeing all cashiering functions effectively. Management of reservations in the PMS, issuance of invoices and billing. Responding to guest calls and emails professionally. Resolving issues and collaborating with other hotel departments.   Qualifications Previous experience in a similar role within a 5* hotel environment. Excellent command of the English language. Good knowledge of MS Office and hotel PMS systems. Communication and collaboration skills, problem-solving abilities, and a strong guest-focused orientation.   Benefits Shared accommodation. Half board. Continuous training and professional development opportunities. Provision of work uniform. Stable and structured working environment. All applications will be treated with absolute confidentiality. After careful evaluation of the CVs, we will contact only the candidates who meet the requirements of the position. #bettertogether #workforall', 'Εποχιακός/ή'),
